---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Musings
description: "Equal parts architecture, threat model, and me arguing with myself."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<section>
  <h1 class="hero__name" style="margin-bottom: var(--sp-md);">Musings</h1>
  <p class="hero__role" style="margin-bottom: var(--sp-2xl); max-width: 46rem; text-wrap: pretty;">
    Things I've built, broken, or thought way too hard about. Mostly the last one.<br>
    Equal parts architecture, threat model, and me arguing with myself.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2 class="section-heading">All Posts</h2>
  <ol class="writing-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <li class="writing-list__item">
      <p class="writing-list__meta">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        {% if post.data.series %}<span aria-hidden="true">·</span> {{ post.data.series }} · part {{ post.data.part }}{% endif %}
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> {{ post.content | readingTime }} min read
      </p>
      <h3 class="writing-list__title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
      {% if post.data.summary %}<p class="writing-list__summary">{{ post.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
